---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const opportunities=[
{letter:'G',name:'Gear',icon:'/images/Gear_G.png',text:'Help develop access to helmets, protective apparel and essential safety equipment for riders facing cost barriers.',url:'/programs/#gear'},
{letter:'E',name:'Education',icon:'/images/Gear_E.png',text:'Help create pathways to rider training, safer riding skills and endorsement-related education.',url:'/programs/#education'},
{letter:'A',name:'Assistance',icon:'/images/Gear_A.png',text:'Help build connections to practical resources, community partners and navigation support.',url:'/programs/#assistance'},
{letter:'R',name:'Recovery',icon:'/images/Gear_R.png',text:'Help develop responsible, need-based recovery assistance for qualifying motorcycle crash expenses and rebuilding.',url:'/programs/#recovery'}
];
---
<Base title="Support the Mission" description="Discover how to support GEAR Moto Foundation's developing motorcycle gear, education, assistance and recovery programs. Giving is not yet open.">
<section class="give-hero"><div class="wrap give-hero-grid"><div><span class="give-overline">BUILD THE MISSION / RIDERS HELPING RIDERS</span><h1>EVERY RIDER<br/>MATTERS.<br/><em>EVERY ACT OF<br/>SUPPORT COUNTS.</em></h1><p>We envision a motorcycle community that shows up before the ride, through the challenges, and after the unexpected. Help us build a foundation that can make that commitment real.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-red" href="#ways-to-support">Explore Ways to Help ↘</a><a class="btn give-outline" href="/impact/">Our Impact Commitment ↗</a></div></div><figure class="give-hero-image"><img src="/images/impact/gear-moto-foundation-our-impact-young-sportbike-riders-community.jpg" alt="Illustrative young sportbike community in protective gear at sunset" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>Illustrative campaign artwork, not a documented program result.</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="give-status"><div class="wrap give-status-inner"><div><span class="give-overline">FOUNDATION DEVELOPMENT</span><h2>WE'RE BUILDING THE ROAD TO GIVING.</h2><p>Online donations are not yet being accepted. Secure payment processing, charitable status disclosures and contribution procedures will be published when verified and ready.</p></div><a href="mailto:donate@gearmotofoundation.org?subject=GEAR%20Giving%20Updates" class="give-status-link">Ask About Giving Opportunities ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="give-purpose" id="ways-to-support"><div class="wrap"><div class="give-section-heading"><span class="give-overline">YOUR SUPPORT / OUR FOUR PILLARS</span><h2>FOUR PILLARS.<br/><em>ONE STRONGER COMMUNITY.</em></h2><p>Support for GEAR's developing charitable mission could help establish the programs, resources and partnerships behind each pillar.</p></div><div class="give-pillar-grid">{opportunities.map((p,i)=><article class="give-pillar-card"><div class="give-pillar-head"><img src={p.icon} alt="" loading="lazy"/><span>0{i+1} / 04</span></div><h3>{p.name}</h3><p>{p.text}</p><a href={p.url}>Discover {p.name} ↗</a></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="give-feature"><div class="wrap give-feature-grid"><div><span class="give-overline">MORE THAN A DONATION</span><h2>THE DIFFERENCE<br/><em>IS WHAT WE BUILD<br/>TOGETHER.</em></h2><p>A meaningful gift is not just a transaction. It's an opportunity to strengthen access, safety, connection and recovery for the people behind the helmets.</p><p>Our development plan combines individual contributions, recurring supporters, mission-aligned sponsorships, equipment and service partnerships, foundation grants and community events—rather than dependence on a single campaign.</p></div><figure class="give-feature-image"><img src="/images/impact/gear-moto-foundation-our-impact-rider-assistance-resources.jpg" alt="Illustrative young rider receiving guidance and resources at a motorcycle community event" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Illustrative representation of our intended community impact.</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="give-pathways"><div class="wrap"><div class="give-section-heading"><span class="give-overline">FIND YOUR PLACE IN GEAR</span><h2>WAYS TO <em>HELP SHAPE THE FUTURE.</em></h2></div><div class="give-pathway-grid"><article><span>01 / COMMUNITY</span><h3>Founding 100</h3><p>A proposed founding supporter campaign bringing together the first community members who want to help build GEAR. Enrollment and contribution details have not launched.</p><a href="mailto:donate@gearmotofoundation.org?subject=Founding%20100%20Interest">Express Interest ↗</a></article><article><span>02 / ONGOING SUPPORT</span><h3>Future Monthly Giving</h3><p>Recurring support could help sustain rider-focused programs once giving infrastructure and program plans are approved. No recurring payments are being collected.</p><a href="mailto:donate@gearmotofoundation.org?subject=Monthly%20Support%20Interest">Ask About the Plan ↗</a></article><article><span>03 / BUSINESS</span><h3>Sponsors & Partners</h3><p>Motorcycle businesses, service providers and mission-aligned companies can discuss future event sponsorships, training opportunities and in-kind partnerships.</p><a href="/partners/">Explore Partnerships ↗</a></article><article><span>04 / GET INVOLVED</span><h3>Time & Expertise</h3><p>Help strengthen the future foundation through skills, community connections, planning and volunteer interest while formal programs are developed.</p><a href="/volunteer/">Get Involved ↗</a></article></div></div></section>
<section class="give-trust"><div class="wrap give-trust-grid"><div><span class="give-overline">TRUST BEFORE TRANSACTIONS</span><h2>SUPPORT SHOULD<br/><em>COME WITH CLARITY.</em></h2><p>Our commitment is to establish responsible financial controls and transparent reporting before presenting a public donation program as operational.</p><a class="give-trust-link" href="/impact/#impact-accountability">Read Our Transparency Approach ↗</a></div><div class="give-trust-panel"><h3>Important giving information</h3><p><strong>Online giving is not open.</strong> Secure donation processing and tax-status documentation have not been confirmed.</p><p>Do not send payments, payment-card information or sensitive financial records through email or the general contact form.</p><p>We will not represent contributions as tax deductible without a verified legal basis. Draft plans, prospective campaigns and projections are not proof of tax-exempt status or operating outcomes.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="give-close"><div class="wrap"><span class="give-overline">ALL BIKES. ALL RIDERS.</span><h2>THE ROAD AHEAD<br/><em>STARTS WITH PEOPLE.</em></h2><p>Want to discuss how you or your organization could help shape GEAR Moto Foundation's future? We'd love to hear from you.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-red" href="mailto:donate@gearmotofoundation.org?subject=GEAR%20Giving%20Inquiry">Talk to Our Giving Team ↗</a><a class="btn btn-outline-dark" href="/partners/">Partner With GEAR ↗</a></div><p class="give-contact">Giving inquiries: <a href="mailto:donate@gearmotofoundation.org">donate@gearmotofoundation.org</a></p></div></section>
</Base>